# Never commit local TLS certificates or private keys (e.g. mkcert output).
# This app never needs local HTTPS — the backend serves plain HTTP and the
# frontend proxies to it over plain HTTP in dev (see
# result-generation-system/next.config.js). If cert files show up here again,
# something has regressed to the old self-signed local-HTTPS setup that
# caused: "self-signed certificate; if the root CA is installed locally,
# try running Node.js with --use-system-ca".
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx